# Optional. A free TMDB key (themoviedb.org → Settings → API) baked into builds so film search works
# out of the box. Either the short "API Key" or the long "API Read Access Token" works.
# Copy this file to .env for local development; for EAS builds, add it as an EAS environment variable.
# Anyone can read an EXPO_PUBLIC_ value inside the app, which is fine for a free TMDB key.
EXPO_PUBLIC_TMDB_KEY=

# Optional: an OMDb key (free at omdbapi.com) built in, so IMDb ratings show without pasting one.
# Its 1,000 lookups a day are shared by everyone using the build.
EXPO_PUBLIC_OMDB_KEY=
